[h1]Flavorium Universalis - Factions v0.2.0: Moved into the main mod[/h1]

[i]Compatible with EU5 1.4.* | Requires: Flavorium Universalis 0.4[/i]

[hr][/hr]

Factions is now part of Flavorium Universalis 0.4: the parties are on a Factions tab of the Court Ledger, controlled by the game rule "C&C: Political Parties" (on by default). This item is empty and can be unsubscribed. Saves that used it carry on unchanged.
